    "created_at": "2016-07-04T01:46:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-04T01:46:29Z",
    "body": "AFAIK, this isn't an intentional violation.  We might misread the specification, or the specification was changed after implementations.\n\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/32\nThe usage of input[type=month] is very low. So,\n- We can correct Blink implementation.  I don't know about WebKit and Edge.\n- We can change the specification.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
