    "created_at": "2016-07-04T06:52:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-04T06:52:01Z",
    "body": "The specification seemed to have this text at least as far back as 2009. Maybe Opera, which I suspect had the first implementation, did it wrong and others copied?\n\nChanging the specification would be quite a bit of work, but returning the number of months might be more useful than returning a number of milliseconds. Especially since you can get the latter using `valueAsDate`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
