    "created_at": "2016-07-04T11:03:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-04T11:03:44Z",
    "body": "Given that every browser that supports `<input type=month>`, including Mobile Safari, returns the same on https://dump.testsuite.org/html/input-month-valueasnumber.html we should just change the standard. It's not worth the churn at this point, although changing the standard will be annoying.\n\nWe should probably also check `<input type=week>` and such as they'll likely require similar changes.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
