    "created_at": "2016-07-05T00:57:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-05T00:57:09Z",
    "body": "I don't think we can change the behavior of input[type=date]. Its usage is much higher.\n\nThe usage of input[type=week] is very low. We can change its behavior.  But I'm not sure we can make it similar to input[type=month] because the number of weeks in one year is not stable.\n",
